{"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Test 5","y":0.062426383841046373,"w":0.061728394826253252,"h":0.013250883392226243,"x":0.86008230454515344,"c":1},{"t":"Now let me tell you about some of the people you need to know. So as I said, I'm Joy Parkins Q17","c":1,"y":0.10532251195118303,"h":0.017301625722429104,"x":0.082239915110204717,"w":0.7923034159342448},{"c":1,"t":"and I decide who does what during the day and how long they work for. I'll be trying to get","h":0.018875789305346613,"w":0.71828786214192708,"y":0.11961523808900731,"x":0.080166095523378444},{"y":0.13808139521602636,"w":0.72839508056640623,"x":0.080246904061779673,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"you to work with as many different people in the kitchen as possible, so that you learn while"},{"y":0.15253239097162907,"w":0.72839508056640634,"t":"you're on the job. One person whose name you must remember is David Field. If you injure","x":0.080246903637193057,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1},{"t":"Q18","y":0.15406976772243497,"w":0.037037035624186143,"x":0.83539094684840076,"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1},{"y":0.16694885897329703,"h":0.017503033538027624,"c":1,"t":"yourself at all, even if it's really minor, you must report to him and he'll make sure the incident","w":0.74498616536458329,"x":0.080182863641536914},{"c":1,"w":0.70793457031249996,"t":"is recorded and you get the appropriate treatment. He's trained to give basic treatment to","x":0.080185111328207576,"h":0.016574479946680154,"y":0.18297275805427327},{"w":0.72427983601888024,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.080246913146068174,"y":0.19905771516489412,"c":1,"t":"staff himself, or he'll send you off somewhere else if necessary. Then there's Dexter Wills -"},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.20058139518767881,"x":0.83539094711246109,"c":1,"t":"Q19","w":0.037037035624186254},{"c":1,"x":0.080156698057537598,"t":"he's the person you need to see if you smash a plate or something like that. Don't just leave","y":0.21269142472727132,"w":0.73063471476236985,"h":0.017704686231130085},{"c":1,"t":"it and hope no one will notice - it's really important to get things noted and replaced or there","x":0.080157913207611772,"w":0.73266764322916667,"h":0.017930835099327025,"y":0.22874278711842411},{"h":0.016782813414808473,"w":0.72644510904947912,"x":0.080201394565286063,"y":0.24341963144803447,"t":"could be problems later. And finally, there's Mike Smith. He's the member of staff who takes","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.25848662785733922,"h":0.017871477016992765,"w":0.70388758341471347,"t":"care of all the stores of perishables, so if you notice we're getting low in flour or sugar or","x":0.080166162032687213},{"y":0.27616279056380022,"c":1,"x":0.080246909715300199,"t":"something, make sure you let him know so he can put in an order.","w":0.52469136555989582,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"h":0.014534882858869391,"w":0.20576131184895832,"t":"OK, now the next thing...","x":0.082304526448634757,"c":1,"y":0.29796511646785206},{"h":0.016195524146054296,"c":1,"x":0.080246910808647987,"t":"SECTION 3","y":0.35600706732262899,"w":0.15637860616048177},{"t":"OK, Stewart. We need to start planning our paper on public libraries. Have you","y":0.38283520871352161,"h":0.018465084237681673,"c":1,"w":0.62572270711263012,"x":0.16245041514154385},{"y":0.39958775025353699,"x":0.16049382876690543,"t":"thought of an angle yet?","h":0.016195524146054074,"c":1,"w":0.1975308609008789},{"t":"STEWART: Well, there's so much we could look into. How libraries have changed over the","x":0.078121885128518323,"h":0.018263521969528962,"c":1,"y":0.41372297795441482,"w":0.70590611775716139},{"y":0.42967625802496867,"t":"centuries, for instance, or how different countries organise them. What do you","w":0.62168090820312494,"h":0.020682070926446139,"x":0.16034890644964578,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"think, Trudie?","x":0.16047259384599774,"y":0.4461394964964791,"w":0.11115357716878257,"h":0.014697751111501178},{"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512463,"w":0.057613169352213542,"x":0.078189299998485493,"t":"TRUDIE:","y":0.46366279058740223},{"y":0.46178074361615018,"w":0.63595296223958331,"h":0.015640481762386194,"c":1,"x":0.16042222758907163,"t":"Maybe we should concentrate on this country, and try and relate the changes in"},{"x":0.16040545263311648,"h":0.016179193737088537,"w":0.652449696858724,"c":1,"y":0.47670751965514957,"t":"libraries to external developments, like the fact that far more people can read than"},{"x":0.16042730448258985,"y":0.49229416551780492,"w":0.65240636189778645,"t":"a century ago, and that the local population may speak lots of different languages.","c":1,"h":0.016612927961405677},{"c":1,"t":"STEWART:","x":0.077983517441808536,"h":0.011696269571149331,"w":0.070370413462320952,"y":0.50941349310731709},{"y":0.5078794655445098,"h":0.015554790923676842,"x":0.16244953937212567,"t":"We could include something about changes in the source of funding, too.","w":0.58250178019205723,"c":1},{"x":0.078137469160745654,"w":0.055659217834472641,"c":1,"t":"TRUDIE:","y":0.52599495319000178,"h":0.0090566052143649101},{"x":0.16037921512417985,"y":0.52240142369507203,"w":0.62573806762695316,"h":0.018348997136308109,"c":1,"t":"Yes, but remember we're only supposed to write a short paper, so it's probably"},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"best if we don't go into funding in any detail.","x":0.15843621467196886,"y":0.53916372174729488,"w":0.35596707661946614},{"y":0.55637229204829253,"w":0.070136324564615896,"h":0.010801927501377429,"t":"STEWART:","c":1,"x":0.078100561894368967},{"c":1,"h":0.016027748233718775,"x":0.15843622111012653,"t":"Right. Well, shall we just brainstorm a few ideas, to get started?","y":0.55523255799259519,"w":0.50823043823242187},{"t":"TRUDIE:","x":0.078189301364323158,"y":0.57267441850951095,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"w":0.055555553436279284,"c":1},{"x":0.16042182463086949,"w":0.62977223714192709,"h":0.016530584530779824,"c":1,"t":"OK. We obviously need to look at the impact of new technology, particularly the","y":0.56962211602484403},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.62757202148437508,"c":1,"x":0.1584362113295911,"t":"internet. Now that lots of books have been digitalised, people can access them","y":0.58568904593237858},{"x":0.16023422115337912,"t":"from their own computers at home.","w":0.28240432739257815,"h":0.015871383837732456,"y":0.59907007752196106,"c":1},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"STEWART:","x":0.076131688117946517,"y":0.61918604642004527,"w":0.069958845774332673,"c":1},{"y":0.6162790696169903,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.15843620879131029,"t":"And if everyone did that, libraries would be obsolete.","w":0.42181070963541667,"c":1},{"t":"TRUDIE:","c":1,"y":0.63352507952256609,"w":0.055676142374674484,"x":0.076071393726333883,"h":0.0091126316146941111},{"y":0.64884444035084154,"h":0.013357630888059413,"c":1,"x":0.0738141178555171,"t":"STEWART:","w":0.072536373138427743},{"c":1,"t":"Q21","w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.83333333372102592,"y":0.46366279053651605},{"y":0.64588989882710823,"w":0.59489562988281253,"h":0.017249979034891116,"c":1,"x":0.15832457042763318,"t":"But the digitalised books that are available online for free are mostly out of"},{"h":0.014534883982160851,"w":0.62345677693684887,"t":"copyright, aren't they? And copyright in this country lasts for 70 years after the","y":0.66279069753398245,"x":0.1584362202194301,"c":1},{"t":"Q22","y":0.64970930217169043,"x":0.82921810759942949,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"c":1,"y":0.67573182094428386,"t":"author dies. So you won't find the latest best-seller or up-to-date information.","h":0.019117573265192478,"w":0.61343994140624991,"x":0.15832584320519932},{"c":1,"y":0.69622093013803921,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.055555553436279298,"t":"TRUDIE:","x":0.076131688199555819},{"c":1,"t":"That's an important point. Anyway, I find it hard to concentrate when I'm reading a","x":0.15836485391166955,"y":0.69306219382151746,"w":0.64829188028971352,"h":0.016314499791013959},{"x":0.15631282775955224,"t":"long text on a screen. I'd much rather read a physical book. And it takes longer to","h":0.016611230668246546,"c":1,"y":0.70879882238583958,"w":0.64827433268229162},{"c":1,"h":0.012149422132224696,"x":0.15827600671633832,"y":0.72488271112769131,"t":"read on a screen.","w":0.1444241460164388},{"y":0.7411443638605304,"h":0.01189731849517639,"x":0.076085964683390378,"t":"STEWART:","c":1,"w":0.067992680867513006},{"c":1,"h":0.011064942790144916,"y":0.75682217974838761,"x":0.075974983601285309,"t":"TRUDIE:","w":0.055868962605794256},{"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054074,"w":0.44032923380533856,"y":0.73969375739641796,"t":"Oh, I prefer it. I suppose it's just a personal preference.","x":0.15843620602341407},{"y":0.75581395334168988,"x":0.15843621952482154,"t":"Mm. I expect that libraries will go on evolving in the next few years. Some have","h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"w":0.62962961832682285},{"y":0.771790341601575,"t":"already become centres where community activities take place, like local clubs","x":0.15637859820213842,"w":0.62757202148437508,"c":1,"h":0.016000356213644928},{"y":0.78621908105549487,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"meeting there. I think that'Il become even more common.","w":0.45473251342773435,"c":1,"x":0.15843621220062223},{"t":"STEWART:","x":0.074074074952339822,"y":0.80377906966011348,"w":0.069958845774332687,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1},{"x":0.15004315096884918,"w":0.6464135233561199,"h":0.021091955429814013,"c":1,"t":"Id like to think so, and that they'll still be serving their traditional function, but l'm","y":0.7991297010269407},{"c":1,"y":0.81578591046085991,"w":0.71005889892578122,"x":0.15627909399644069,"h":0.018621905251582693,"t":"not so sure. There are financial implications, after all. What I'm afraid will happen is Q23"},{"t":"that books and magazines will all disappear, and there'll just be rows and rows of","x":0.1542297265630441,"y":0.83182753915430152,"w":0.65038594563802077,"h":0.016883882673104034,"c":1},{"t":"computers. They won't look anything like the libraries we're used to.","x":0.15432098912359957,"y":0.84883720916760441,"w":0.54526748657226565,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"t":"TRODIE:","y":0.86622965157939424,"h":0.010273254942697374,"c":1,"x":0.071998402449536453,"w":0.05559167226155598},{"w":0.125514399210612,"h":0.01453830777405285,"c":1,"t":"Well, we'll see.","y":0.86336866908162369,"x":0.1543209895353698},{"x":0.88477366207572383,"w":0.026748971939086874,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"97","y":0.93604651145089246},{"w":0.20824633280436194,"x":0.39483721299237268,"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96768258536995222,"h":0.016454192297478354,"c":1}],"h":3395}